- To summarize
    A GAN battle ends with an image that’s ready to be shown to a human. Sometimes, the human might
    laugh and think the resulting image is ridiculous. But other times, the human, like the CNN acting
    as judge and teacher, won’t be able to tell the difference. At that point, the deep fake is a
    success!